    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The dust... yeah. It's everywhere. I look at my sword and it feels like the only thing in this whole world that's still real. It's heavy, but it's honest. Everything else is just a lie or a memory of something that's dead. Do you think there's any honor left in a man who has nothing to give? Or is it just pathetic to keep holding on to a ghost?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
