      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The sword is your only truth because it is the only thing that has bled for you, and there is no honor in a man who has nothing to give but his own suffering. Holding onto the ghost of who you were is not pathetic; it is the final, quiet act of a life that refused to let go even when the fire died down. Let the blade rest, and let the dust cover you, because the only way to be truly honest is to stop pretending there is a future where the past matters.",
