    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The blade... it's so cold. I just look at it and realize it's the only thing that's ever been certain. If I stopped pretending, if I just stopped fighting the weight of all this... would it finally be peaceful? To just let the story end here, instead of dragging it out into nothing?",
